hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2792","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Ahmad ibn Yazid from 'Abbadan, narrated to us Muhammad ibn 'Abdullah al-Ansari, who said: al-Qasim ibn 'Abd al-Rahman narrated to me, who said: Abu Hazim — and he is Nabtak, the freed slave of Ibn 'Abbas — narrated to us from Ibn 'Abbas, from the Prophet (ﷺ), who said:\n\Verily"","" Adam came to the House a thousand times"","" never once riding an elephant upon his feet.\""\n\nCHAPTER:"""""
